OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed after 'Good Samaritan'
OL,4,Akilling retrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed for killing a
OL,7,F"Good Samaritan" who stepped in to help
OL,8,Fa 17-year-old girl who had been
OL,9,Fassaulted.
OL,11,FReece Radford, 26, was fatally stabbed
OL,12,Fwhen he intervened in the altercation
OL,13,Fin Arundel Gate, Sheffield, in 2022.
OL,15,FLouis James and Dereck Owusu were
OL,16,Foriginally jailed for life in 2023
OL,17,Fafter being convicted of Radford's
OL,18,Fmurder, but after appealing against
OL,19,Ftheir convictions a retrial was held
OL,20,Fand James was convicted of murder while
OL,21,FOwusu was instead found guilty of
OL,22,Fmanslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
